un, Medic ...), weapon, distance in meters, a health bar built from all six limbs, head and torso health, skeleton, tracers and head dot\n- Status flags DOWNED, SPAWN, DISGUISED and VEHICLE, a wall check that highlights visible enemies, teammates optional\n- Vehicle ESP for enemy vehicles, judged by the crew's team, so captured vehicles show up on the right side\n- Aimbot: a camera aimbot that compensates bullet drop and leads moving targets with the game's own ballistics. FOV circle, sticky target, visible only, a humaniser (reaction delay, wind-up, speed ceiling) and a panic key\n- Silent aim: bends your real shot onto enemies only, never teammates, and only when the bullet can really reach them. Head / Torso / Nearest / Random, FOV in degrees, hit chance and lead. Off by default\n- World: no fog, fullbright, no suppression blur\n- Info: tickets, your K/D and a staff detector\n\nMOBILE\nWorks on PC and mobile - the panel asks once and scales itself, in German, English and Russian.\n\nHOW TO RUN\n1. Open Cold War [VIETNAM]\n2. Paste the loader into your executor\n3. Execute - the panel opens by itself\n4. Press RightShift to show or hide it\n\nNo key, no ads, and it never spends Robux.\n\nOpen source, read it before you run it:\nhttps://github.com/seltonmt012/sel01-rbx/blob/main/games/coldwar.lua\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/ARdpzFuKMm","tags":["esp","aimbot","silent aim","vehicle esp","no key"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/ARdpzFuKMm","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","username":"Seltonmt","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0ded360520c1951d28fd502cf078aeca6b05bb87c667cba5445a03bd584b31ec.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b-1787205594420.png"},"lvl":7,"status":"offline","id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0ded360520c1951d28fd502cf078aeca6b05bb87c667cba5445a03bd584b31ec.webp","o